{"license":"CC0-1.0","fileAccessRequest":false,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Met de coach naar de job, een evaluatie van de pilot stagejobcoach"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"ARVODI - Projectnummer: B3693"}},{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:50143"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Panteia Research voor Beleid"}},{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"L. Coenen"}},{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"B. Noordhuizen"}},{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"S. de Visser"}},{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"M. Engelen"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"L  Coenen"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>In de pilot stagejobcoach werden leerlingen uit het Voortgezet Speciaal Onderwijs en het Praktijkonderwijs tijdens de stageperiode begeleid door een stagejobcoach. De stagejobcoach zou de overgang van school naar werk voor deze jongeren vergemakkelijken.<br>Uit de evaluatie van de pilot blijkt dat de inzet van de stagejobcoach niet zorgt voor een groter aantal leerlingen dat hun stage volledig doorloopt. De stagejobcoach heeft wel effect op de wijze waarop de stages verlopen. Met inzet van een stagejobcoach verlopen de stages over het algemeen namelijk probleemlozer.<br>Ook blijkt dat de inzet van de stagejobcoach een positief effect heeft op het aantal leerlingen dat uitstroomt naar reguliere arbeid, dit geldt in het bijzonder voor leerlingen van VSO cluster 3 scholen.<\/p>"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Social Sciences"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"stagejobcoach"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"arbeidsparticipatie"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Wajong"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Voortgezet speciaal onderwijs"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Praktijkonderwijs"}}]},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2011-10-07"},{"typeName":"contributor","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"ARVODI Regeling\nEen onderzoek in opdracht van het Ministerie van Sociale Zaken\nen Werkgelegenheid - Projectnummer: B3693"}}]},{"typeName":"distributionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2012-06-01"},{"typeName":"dateOfDeposit","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2012-06-01"}]},"dansRights":{"displayName":"Rights Metadata","name":"dansRights","fields":[{"typeName":"dansRightsHolder"